{
  "archetype": "dual_track_discovery",
  "display_name": "Dual Track Discovery and Delivery",
  "family": "experimental",
  "summary": "Hypothesis driven discovery feeding a delivery track, suited to research and ML work.",
  "template_version": "2026.10",
  "states": [
    {
      "key": "opportunity_backlog",
      "name": "Opportunity Backlog",
      "category": "backlog",
      "initial": true,
      "terminal": false,
      "wip_limit": null,
      "sla_hours": null,
      "entry_criteria": [],
      "exit_criteria": []
    },
    {
      "key": "hypothesis_framing",
      "name": "Hypothesis Framing",
      "category": "todo",
      "initial": false,
      "terminal": false,
      "wip_limit": null,
      "sla_hours": null,
      "entry_criteria": [],
      "exit_criteria": [
        "Falsifiable hypothesis",
        "Success metric and kill criteria agreed"
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "discovery_research",
      "name": "Discovery Research",
      "category": "in_progress",
      "initial": false,
      "terminal": false,
      "wip_limit": 4,
      "sla_hours": 120,
      "entry_criteria": [],
      "exit_criteria": []
    },
    {
      "key": "experiment_running",
      "name": "Experiment Running",
      "category": "in_progress",
      "initial": false,
      "terminal": false,
      "wip_limit": 3,
      "sla_hours": null,
      "entry_criteria": [],
      "exit_criteria": []
    },
    {
      "key": "evidence_review",
      "name": "Evidence Review",
      "category": "review",
      "initial": false,
      "terminal": false,
      "wip_limit": null,
      "sla_hours": 48,
      "entry_criteria": [],
      "exit_criteria": []
    },
    {
      "key": "delivery_backlog",
      "name": "Delivery Backlog",
      "category": "todo",
      "initial": false,
      "terminal": false,
      "wip_limit": null,
      "sla_hours": null,
      "entry_criteria": [],
      "exit_criteria": []
    },
    {
      "key": "building",
      "name": "Building",
      "category": "in_progress",
      "initial": false,
      "terminal": false,
      "wip_limit": 5,
      "sla_hours": null,
      "entry_criteria": [],
      "exit_criteria": []
    },
    {
      "key": "validation_in_production",
      "name": "Validation in Production",
      "category": "review",
      "initial": false,
      "terminal": false,
      "wip_limit": null,
      "sla_hours": null,
      "entry_criteria": [],
      "exit_criteria": []
    },
    {
      "key": "learned_and_shipped",
      "name": "Learned and Shipped",
      "category": "done",
      "initial": false,
      "terminal": true,
      "wip_limit": null,
      "sla_hours": null,
      "entry_criteria": [],
      "exit_criteria": []
    },
    {
      "key": "blocked",
      "name": "Blocked",
      "category": "blocked",
      "initial": false,
      "terminal": false,
      "wip_limit": null,
      "sla_hours": null,
      "entry_criteria": [],
      "exit_criteria": []
    },
    {
      "key": "discarded",
      "name": "Discarded",
      "category": "cancelled",
      "initial": false,
      "terminal": true,
      "wip_limit": null,
      "sla_hours": null,
      "entry_criteria": [],
      "exit_criteria": []
    }
  ],
  "transitions": [
    {
      "key": "frame_hypothesis",
      "name": "Frame hypothesis",
      "from": "opportunity_backlog",
      "to": "hypothesis_framing",
      "guards": [],
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "key": "begin_discovery",
      "name": "Begin discovery",
      "from": "hypothesis_framing",
      "to": "discovery_research",
      "guards": [
        {
          "type": "field_required",
          "field": "success_metric"
        },
        {
          "type": "field_required",
          "field": "kill_criteria"
        }
      ],
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "key": "launch_experiment",
      "name": "Launch experiment",
      "from": "discovery_research",
      "to": "experiment_running",
      "guards": [
        {
          "type": "linked_artifact",
          "artifact": "experiment_design"
        }
      ],
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "key": "collect_evidence",
      "name": "Collect evidence",
      "from": "experiment_running",
      "to": "evidence_review",
      "guards": [],
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "key": "iterate_research",
      "name": "Iterate research",
      "from": "evidence_review",
      "to": "discovery_research",
      "guards": [],
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "key": "discard_hypothesis",
      "name": "Discard hypothesis",
      "from": "evidence_review",
      "to": "discarded",
      "guards": [
        {
          "type": "field_required",
          "field": "learning_summary"
        }
      ],
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "key": "promote_to_delivery",
      "name": "Promote to delivery",
      "from": "evidence_review",
      "to": "delivery_backlog",
      "guards": [
        {
          "type": "approval",
          "role": "product_trio",
          "min_approvals": 2,
          "distinct_from_author": false
        }
      ],
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "key": "start_build",
      "name": "Start build",
      "from": "delivery_backlog",
      "to": "building",
      "guards": [
        {
          "type": "wip_available"
        }
      ],
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "key": "ship_for_validation",
      "name": "Ship for validation",
      "from": "building",
      "to": "validation_in_production",
      "guards": [],
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "key": "outcome_missed",
      "name": "Outcome missed",
      "from": "validation_in_production",
      "to": "building",
      "guards": [],
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "key": "confirm_outcome",
      "name": "Confirm outcome",
      "from": "validation_in_production",
      "to": "learned_and_shipped",
      "guards": [
        {
          "type": "field_required",
          "field": "measured_outcome"
        }
      ],
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "key": "block",
      "name": "Block",
      "from": "building",
      "to": "blocked",
      "guards": [],
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "key": "unblock",
      "name": "Unblock",
      "from": "blocked",
      "to": "building",
      "guards": [],
      "actions": []
    }
  ],
  "triggers": [
    {
      "key": "experiment_metrics_attach",
      "event": "transition_completed",
      "condition": "transition == 'collect_evidence'",
      "action": "attach:experiment_dashboard",
      "description": "Attaches experiment telemetry to the evidence review.",
      "params": {}
    },
    {
      "key": "kill_criteria_check",
      "event": "scheduled",
      "condition": "state == 'experiment_running'",
      "action": "evaluate:kill_criteria;notify:product_trio",
      "description": "Evaluates kill criteria daily while experiments run.",
      "params": {}
    },
    {
      "key": "learning_log",
      "event": "transition_completed",
      "condition": "transition in ['discard_hypothesis', 'confirm_outcome']",
      "action": "append_learning_log",
      "description": "Records every validated or invalidated hypothesis.",
      "params": {}
    }
  ],
  "ceremonies": [
    {
      "name": "Discovery sync",
      "cadence": "twice_weekly",
      "duration_minutes": 30,
      "participants": [
        "product_trio",
        "researcher"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Evidence review",
      "cadence": "weekly",
      "duration_minutes": 60,
      "participants": [
        "product_trio",
        "data_scientist"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Delivery planning",
      "cadence": "biweekly",
      "duration_minutes": 60,
      "participants": [
        "product_trio",
        "engineer"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "roles": [
    "product_trio",
    "researcher",
    "data_scientist",
    "engineer",
    "stakeholder"
  ],
  "cadence": {
    "type": "dual_track",
    "discovery_cycle_days": 7,
    "delivery_iteration_days": 14
  },
  "metrics": [
    "hypotheses_tested",
    "validated_learning_rate",
    "time_to_evidence",
    "outcome_attainment"
  ],
  "anchors": {
    "intake": "opportunity_backlog",
    "rework": "building",
    "release_transition": "confirm_outcome",
    "done": "learned_and_shipped",
    "blocked": "blocked",
    "build_states": [
      "building",
      "discovery_research"
    ],
    "review_states": [
      "evidence_review",
      "validation_in_production"
    ]
  },
  "description_text": "Workflow template: Dual Track Discovery and Delivery (dual_track_discovery).\nHypothesis driven discovery feeding a delivery track, suited to research and ML work.\nStates in order: Opportunity Backlog, Hypothesis Framing, Discovery Research, Experiment Running, Evidence Review, Delivery Backlog, Building, Validation in Production, Learned and Shipped, Blocked, Discarded.\nTransition Frame hypothesis moves work from opportunity_backlog to hypothesis_framing with no guard.\nTransition Begin discovery moves work from hypothesis_framing to discovery_research with required field success metric; required field kill criteria.\nTransition Launch experiment moves work from discovery_research to experiment_running with linked experiment design.\nTransition Collect evidence moves work from experiment_running to evidence_review with no guard.\nTransition Iterate research moves work from evidence_review to discovery_research with no guard.\nTransition Discard hypothesis moves work from evidence_review to discarded with required field learning summary.\nTransition Promote to delivery moves work from evidence_review to delivery_backlog with approval by 2 product trio.\nTransition Start build moves work from delivery_backlog to building with wip available.\nTransition Ship for validation moves work from building to validation_in_production with no guard.\nTransition Outcome missed moves work from validation_in_production to building with no guard.\nTransition Confirm outcome moves work from validation_in_production to learned_and_shipped with required field measured outcome.\nTransition Block moves work from building to blocked with no guard.\nTransition Unblock moves work from blocked to building with no guard.\nAutomation experiment_metrics_attach: Attaches experiment telemetry to the evidence review.\nAutomation kill_criteria_check: Evaluates kill criteria daily while experiments run.\nAutomation learning_log: Records every validated or invalidated hypothesis.\nCeremonies: Discovery sync, Evidence review, Delivery planning.\nPrimary metrics: hypotheses tested, validated learning rate, time to evidence, outcome attainment."
}